{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19210","headline":"和仆射牛相公春日闲坐见怀 · 刘禹锡","name":"和仆射牛相公春日闲坐见怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官曹崇重难频入，第宅清闲且独行。\n阶蚁相逢如偶语，园蜂速去恐违程。\n人於红药惟看色，莺到垂杨不惜声。\n东洛池台怨抛掷，移文非久会应成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19210.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19210","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}